                        <h1 id="pageTitle"><a href="https://direc.to/pqJn">Silver Bells Watch Party</a></h1>
                        <p>This Friday, stay warm inside the Gannon Building while you enjoy holiday activities
                           and watch the Silver Bells parade on the big screens. Free and open to the community.
                           Please register to attend.</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-item"><img src="/_resources/images/_hp-slider/2026-help-portrait-hp-slide.jpg" class="d-block w-100 topAlignTop" alt="a family in the help portrait studio getting their family picture"><div class="carousel-caption text-start col-md-4 offset-md-0">
                        <h1><a href="/lccpresident/help-portrait.html">Help-Portrait is back!</a></h1>
                        <p>If you live in the Greater Lansing area and your family doesn’t have access to or
                           is unable to afford professional photography, Help-Portrait at LCC was created for
                           you.&nbsp; This year's event is Saturday, Dec. 5. Sign up today!</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-item"><img src="/_resources/images/_hp-slider/2026-foundation-scholarships-hp-slide.jpg" class="d-block w-100 topAlignTop" alt="distance shot of a graduate at commencement in the crowd of graduates"><div class="carousel-caption text-start col-md-4 offset-md-5">
                        <h1><a href="/financial-aid/scholarships/index.html">Get funds to cover tuition, books and other educational expenses!</a></h1>
                        <p>Apply for the LCC Foundation Scholarship by Jan. 31, 2027, for the fall 2027 through
                           spring 2028 semesters.</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-item"><img src="/_resources/images/_hp-slider/2026-spring-27-registration-hp-slide.jpg" class="d-block w-100 topAlignTop" alt="students walking around campus - one student sitting and looking at a laptop"><div class="carousel-caption text-start col-md-4 offset-md-5">
                        <h1><a href="https://direc.to/pxnd">Register now for the spring semester</a></h1>
                        <p>The next semester starts in January 2027. Register now for the best class options!</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-item"><img src="/_resources/images/_hp-slider/2026-mi-reconnect-age-hp-slide.jpg" class="d-block w-100 topAlignTop" alt="a graduate at commencement"><div class="carousel-caption text-start col-md-4 offset-md-5">
                        <h1><a href="/financial-aid/scholarships/mireconnect.html">Michigan Reconnect age requirement lowered to 21</a></h1>
                        <p>You may be eligible for free or reduced tuition through the Michigan Reconnect program.</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-item"><img src="/_resources/images/_hp-slider/2026-hispanic-heritage-celebration-hp-slide.jpg" class="d-block w-100 topAlignTop" alt="a hispanic culture celebration event with women and children dancing with colorful dresses"><div class="carousel-caption text-start col-md-4 offset-md-0">
                        <h1><a href="/calendar/#event-details/2a116954-62bb-4d29-b7cc-009980eb1e6f">“Juntos somos más” (Together, We Are More)</a></h1>
                        <p>The Office of Empowerment invites everyone to celebrate Hispanic heritage with a celebration
                           to honor the rich history, diverse cultures and contributions of Hispanic and Latino
                           Communities. Join us Nov. 23, 2026 from 5:30 - 7:30p.m. Register to join us.</p>
